{"id":"game_events_cul_dialogue:12884902656","locale":"jp","text":"塗山小玉"}
{"id":"game_events_cul_dialogue:12884902912","locale":"jp","text":"うぅ、疲れたぁ……\n侠客さんの肩と桃花餅で充電したいよう……"}
{"id":"game_events_cul_dialogue:17179869952","locale":"jp","text":"塗山小玉"}
{"id":"game_events_cul_dialogue:17179870208","locale":"jp","text":"気づけばこんなに続けてきたんだね！\n試験が終わったら、シュガーパイ30個、一気に食べちゃうんだから！"}
{"id":"game_events_cul_dialogue:21474837248","locale":"jp","text":"源千代"}
{"id":"game_events_cul_dialogue:21474837504","locale":"jp","text":"修行計画は確認済みです。さあ、はじめましょう。"}
{"id":"game_events_cul_dialogue:25769804544","locale":"jp","text":"源千代"}
{"id":"game_events_cul_dialogue:25769804800","locale":"jp","text":"本日の予定をこなしていきましょう。"}
{"id":"game_events_cul_dialogue:30064771840","locale":"jp","text":"源千代"}
{"id":"game_events_cul_dialogue:30064772096","locale":"jp","text":"すこし疲れが溜まっていますが、\n気を緩めるわけにはいきません……"}
{"id":"game_events_cul_dialogue:34359739136","locale":"jp","text":"源千代"}
{"id":"game_events_cul_dialogue:34359739392","locale":"jp","text":"明日は『最後の出征』。気を引き締めなければ！"}
{"id":"game_events_cul_dialogue:38654706432","locale":"jp","text":"源千代"}
{"id":"game_events_cul_dialogue:38654706688","locale":"jp","text":"あ、あの……いきなりなにを……？"}
{"id":"game_events_cul_dialogue:4294968064","locale":"jp","text":"塗山小玉"}
{"id":"game_events_cul_dialogue:4294968320","locale":"jp","text":"うちの準備はできてるよ！さあ、修行開始！"}
{"id":"game_events_cul_dialogue:8589935360","locale":"jp","text":"塗山小玉"}
{"id":"game_events_cul_dialogue:8589935616","locale":"jp","text":"修行の時間？集中しなきゃ……！"}
